                        <field name="dc_subject">Fagoaga and Dutari, Anacleto de </field>
                        <field name="dc_title">Don Anacleto de Fagoaga y Dutari, Secretary with vote of the Supreme Board of Represalias,... tells me what follows [Printed text]: "Supreme Board of Represalias. By Royal Decree of June 21 of this year, circulated to all the Justicias and Courts of the Kingdom, it was served S. M. create a Court with the denomination of Board of Repressals to understand in all the relative abduction and confiscation of French goods, either passersby, domiciles. </field>
